  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The Alkanes and their mono bromo dervative are as given below,</p><p>There are three alkanes possible with the formula<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></math>,</p><p>n-pentane, iso-pentane and neo-pentane.</p><p>And identify the possible mono bromo derivatives formed by each isomer.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/da9ffa52-6ca6-4163-b8c0-bdd102df3d10-image.png\" style=\"width: 524px; height: 280px;\" />​​​​​​​</p></blockquote>",
